{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07436","headline":"送灵澈上人还越中 · 刘长卿","name":"送灵澈上人还越中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"禅客无心杖锡还，沃洲深处草堂闲。\n身随敝屦经残雪，手绽寒衣入旧山。\n独向青溪依树下，空留白日在人间。\n那堪别後长相忆，云木苍苍但闭关。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07436.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07436","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}